---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant DB as Evaluators DB
    participant WASM as Wasm Runtime

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo evaluator test
    activate Vigilo

    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Parse evaluator identifier
    Vigilo->>DB: Select evaluator by identity

    alt Evaluator found and testable
        DB-->>Vigilo: Evaluator record
        Vigilo->>Vigilo: Read and parse test input
        Vigilo->>WASM: Verify stored ABI and dispatch its adapter with input
        WASM-->>Vigilo: Evaluation output
        Vigilo->>Vigilo: Build native measurement and diagnostics payload
        Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    else Evaluator missing
        DB-->>Vigilo: No evaluator record
        Vigilo-->>User: Not found error
    else Evaluator cannot run
        Vigilo-->>User: State error
    else Input or execution fails
        Vigilo-->>User: Test error
    end

    deactivate Vigilo
